WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.113 --> 00:00:03.527
(haunting stringed music)

00:00:03.527 --> 00:00:06.063
- [Woman] This is Ciel, an ocelot.

00:00:06.063 --> 00:00:07.480
She is beautiful.

00:00:09.378 --> 00:00:11.961
But, her beauty is her downfall.

00:00:19.463 --> 00:00:21.306
Twice the size of an average house cat,

00:00:21.306 --> 00:00:23.022
but with shorter than average legs,

00:00:23.022 --> 00:00:25.170
speed isn't their specialty.

00:00:25.170 --> 00:00:26.170
They ambush.

00:00:28.935 --> 00:00:33.102
Rodents, birds, fish, if
it's meat, they'll eat it.

00:00:34.274 --> 00:00:36.060
We almost lost the ocelot.

00:00:36.060 --> 00:00:38.660
They're alluring coat, with
its distinctive pattern,

00:00:38.660 --> 00:00:41.949
was highly desired in the fur trade.

00:00:41.949 --> 00:00:44.449
They were hunted aggressively.

00:00:45.463 --> 00:00:46.970
It used to be that you could find them

00:00:46.970 --> 00:00:48.758
throughout the Southwestern U.S.

00:00:48.758 --> 00:00:52.371
and all the way down to
the bottom of Brazil.

00:00:52.371 --> 00:00:56.204
Now there's only 40 left
in the wild in Texas.

00:00:57.256 --> 00:01:00.075
More exist in pockets of
Central and South America,

00:01:00.075 --> 00:01:04.242
but the danger of shrinking
habitats is always looming.

00:01:06.170 --> 00:01:07.753
This is the ocelot.

00:01:10.117 --> 00:01:13.284
(light chiming music)

00:01:14.987 --> 00:01:19.154
(moves into spacey electronic music)

